# esbuild ships a prebuilt binary and needs its install script to run for Vite.
# Everything else stays blocked by pnpm's default script sandboxing.
#
# Note: the database test harness deliberately uses Node's built-in `node:sqlite`
# (SQLite 3.51, FTS5 + trigram tokenizer) rather than a native module, so the
# real migrations and the real search SQL can be exercised on any machine with
# no compiler toolchain.
onlyBuiltDependencies[]=esbuild
